Limitations on net land gains for the federal
HB0118
government.
Sponsored By: Representative(s) Banks, Andrew, Haroldson, Tarver
and Winter and Senator(s) Ide, Kolb and Steinmetz
AN ACT relating to state lands and conveyances; limiting conveyances, exchanges
and sales of land to prohibit the federal government from net increases in land
within Wyoming; providing definitions; specifying applicability; and providing
for an effective date.
