HB0118H3004/FAILED (CORRECTED CORRECTED COPY)
Delete the Geringer third reading amendment (HB0118H3001/A), the Harshman third
reading amendment (HB0118H3002/A) and the Byron third

reading amendment (HB0118H3003/A) entirely and further
amend as follows:
Page 2-line 9 After "Wyoming" insert ", except private property
subject to subsection (c) of this section,".
Page 2-after line 10 Insert:
"(c) The state of Wyoming shall have the right of first refusal for any
conveyance of private property in Wyoming that would result in a net gain of
property to the United States in violation of subsection (b) of this section.
The office of state lands and investments shall adopt rules necessary to enable
the state to consider purchases of private property under this subsection. The
rules adopted under this subsection shall require the agency of the United
States that is part of a transaction subject to this subsection to notify the
office of the transaction not later than ninety (90) days before the closing
date of the transaction.". BANKS
HB0118H3005/ADOPTED
Page 2-line 10 After "United States." insert "It shall not be a
violation of this subsection if the United States
acquires private property and agrees to dispose or
exchange land equal in size and fair market value to
the state within one (1) year of the conveyance. The
disposal or exchange of land by the United States shall
not be required to be in the same area as the private
property that is conveyed to the United States.".
